000000">Who we're looking for:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></h4><p class="Paragraph SCXW196443394 BCX4">&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW196443394 BCX4"><span style="color:#000000">As part of our growing team, you will play a key role in shaping the future of sustainable product development. We’re looking for innovative, driven Site Reliability Engineers who are passionate about technology and sustainability to join us in building tools that enable companies to make smarter, more responsible decisions. In this role, you’ll have the opportunity to collaborate with talented professionals, contribute to cutting-edge projects, and help drive the digital transformation of industries worldwide. If you're ready to make an impact and contribute to meaningful change, we want to hear from you!&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW196443394 BCX4"><span style="color:#000000">This role is a fixed, permanent position. All successful applicants will need to reside in Germany with legal working permits or residence permits.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW196443394 BCX4"><span style="color:#333E49">&nbsp;</span></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#000000">The role:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></h4><p class="Paragraph SCXW196443394 BCX4">&nbsp;</p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW196443394 BCX4"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196443394 BCX4"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Infrastructure Management:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Maintain and manage new and existing infrastructure, balancing both proactive and reactive maintenance.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW196443394 BCX4"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196443394 BCX4"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Technical Problem Identification and Resolution:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Identify technical problems and bottlenecks. Collaborate with the engineering team to resolve these issues efficiently.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW196443394 BCX4"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196443394 BCX4"><strong><span style="color:#121317">ISO Compliance:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Ensure all infrastructure and processes are in compliance with ISO standards, and assist in maintaining those certifications.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW196443394 BCX4"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196443394 BCX4"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Production Support:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Work closely with engineering teams to ensure our developed tools and applications run smoothly in a production environment.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Backup Management:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Oversee and manage all system backups, ensuring Recovery Time Objectives (RTO) and Recovery Point Objectives (RPO) are met.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW196443394 BCX4"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196443394 BCX4"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Release Management Support:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Assist in managing software releases to minimize disruption and maximize uptime.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW196443394 BCX4"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196443394 BCX4"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Off-Duty Support:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Participate in an off-duty or pager duty rotation to provide round-the-clock system reliability and support.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW196443394 BCX4"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196443394 BCX4"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Incident Review and Analysis:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Lead postmortems following any system disruptions, and help identify ways to prevent future incidents.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW196443394 BCX4"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196443394 BCX4"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Infrastructure Monitoring:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Monitor system alerts and respond quickly to maintain system health and maximize uptime.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW196443394 BCX4"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW196443394 BCX4"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Capacity Planning:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Participate in planning server capacity, ensuring we can meet current and future demands&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul> <br> <ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW100465259 BCX4"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW100465259 BCX4"><span style="color:#121317">Bachelor's degree in computer science, IT, or a related field.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW100465259 BCX4"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW100465259 BCX4"><span style="color:#121317">7+ years of experience in site reliability engineering or a similar role.</span></p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW100465259 BCX4"><span style="color:#121317">3+ years in SRE, DevOps, or related infrastructure roles&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW100465259 BCX4"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW100465259 BCX4"><span style="color:#121317">Experience supporting/coaching less experienced team members.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Ability in building alerting and observability into all production systems (Prometheus, Grafana, CloudWatch etc.)</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW100465259 BCX4"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW100465259 BCX4"><span style="color:#121317">Proven experience with cloud platforms, preferably AWS (ECS, EC2, etc) or Azure.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW100465259 BCX4"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW100465259 BCX4"><span style="color:#121317">Extensive experience using Terraform and Ansible.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="col