ion and work that doesn't deliver measured impact is honestly reverted.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What you will own and deliver</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Customer Surfaces:</strong> Own the end-to-end design and UX strategy across web, iOS, and Android for all core journey stages: homepage, search &amp; browse, product pages, basket, slot selection, checkout, and order tracking.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Design System as a Product:</strong> Own component architecture, design tokens, patterns, and documentation, ensuring our coding agents have precise design guidance to generate accurate interfaces.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI Experience Design:</strong> Define the interaction patterns for Maia (our AI shopping assistant), governing when it intervenes, how it presents information, and how it hands over to human support.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Experimentation &amp; Analysis:</strong> Drive hypotheses, prototype rapidly, and evaluate A/B test results objectively — scaling successful experiments and sunsetting features that miss target performance.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Direct User Research:</strong> Conduct qualitative interviews, usability tests, and field research directly with customers to continuously uncover friction points.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Cross-Functional Partnership:</strong> Collaborate closely with the Product Owner, Engineering Manager, Tech Lead, and your peer product designer, while providing design input to Commercial, Marketing, and Operations.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What we are looking for</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>5+ years of experience</strong> designing consumer-facing digital products with a strong portfolio of shipped work across both web and native mobile (iOS and Android).</p></li