cked by the global technological power of Infosys.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience, Tech &amp;amp; AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are a cross-unit and cross-location AI, tech and experience team. With more than 50 developers, AI engineers, technical artists and consultants working directly with other WongDoody teams, we are team players and specialists - both in frontend and backend, as well as in creative production pipelines. As part of Infosys, we belong to a leading global technology company with access to solutions and extensive know-how in the fields of commerce, marketing automation and AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Work where it works for you. At home or in the office, or any mix you like&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Working for strong brands and clients we believe in&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;30 days&#39; vacation per year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Urban Sports Club&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nice people in welcoming teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you can expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build modern, high-performance web interfaces for complex applications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Translate UX/UI concepts into scalable and responsive frontend architectures&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Design interfaces that make complex AI and agent-driven systems intuitive and usable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use the state-of-the-art toolchain, e.g. Github Copilot, WebComponents, React, TypeScript, Storybook and Docker&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Realize of ambitious and performant animations by using JS &amp;amp; CSS&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Develop and integrate APIs for data- and AI-driven applications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Design, AI Engineers, and Solution Architects&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Design modular components and reusable system patterns&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bring structure to technical decisions and reduce system complexity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Contribute to RFPs, pitches, and interactive prototypes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;d love to see&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;5+ years of practical experience in commercial projects&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Very strong technical knowledge of TypeScript and frontend frameworks like React or simialr&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Practical knowledge around WebComponents, based on StencilJS Library&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience in documenting component libraries using Storybook&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI coding tools in a responsible manner&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience in technical communication with customers’ technical stakeholders, such as solution architects, technical leads, and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ability to explain technical concepts, architectural decisions, and implementation details clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Mentorship of the members of the Frontend Engineering Team&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with agile project management processes such as Scrum or Kanban&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Very good German and English language levels (C1+)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Work permit in Germany and at least one year of work onsite in Germany&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;We care about your personality and professional skills. We don&#39;t care about your gender, age, nationality or appearance and are open to working with everyone.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please note: This is a job ad by WongDoody GmbH based in Germany. Through our website or other sources, you may find job ads published by one of our WongDoody sister companies around the globe with whom we act jointly under the band “WongDoody”. For each job offer, only the entity is responsible, which has published the ad. Contact persons, required information and applicable terms may differ. You can inform yourself how WongDoody GmbH is processing your personal data provided in the application process&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wongdoody.com/wongdoody-germany-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have any questions about the application process, feel free to contact our People &amp;amp; Culture Team directly under -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/wongdoody/director-frontend-engineer-berlin-de-481191","tags":["Development"],"job_types":[],"location":"Berlin, DE","created_at":1793472924},{"slug":"associate-account-executive-top-talent-sales-program-lunar-dach-munich-312838","company_name":"celonis","title":"Associate Account Executive (Top Talent Sales Program - Lunar) DACH","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunar Sales:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Celonis Lunar Sales is a fast-track, 2-year development programme designed for ambitious professionals who want to accelerate their career at the intersection of AI, enterprise technology, and strategic sales.&amp;nbsp; If you have experience solving complex problems in a client-facing role, in management or strategy consulting or a leading industry strategy function and you are ready to bring that expertise into enterprise sales, this is your launchpad.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Program immerses you in every stage of the customer sales journey, supported by motivating leaders who will help accelerate your growth beyond expectations. If you&#39;re an innovative thinker who thrives on overcoming challenges, our Top Talent Sales Program will provide strategic significance, arming you with the knowledge and tools to address complex problems, create meaningful change and excel as an Account Executive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast-track your growth in enterprise sales through our exclusive top talent program. You will gain hands-on experience selling AI-driven business transformation, build relationships with industry leaders across Celonis verticals, including Automotive, Manufacturing, Banking, FSI,&amp;nbsp; Life Sciences, Consumer Goods, Retail, Energy and Public Sector and develop the leadership skills needed to drive real change for enterprise customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The program focuses on three key pillars&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Strategic Business Development &amp;amp; Executive Relationship Building&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of generating your own pipeline through cold outreach, persona identification, and first meetings, driving directly towards concrete KPI and revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with C-suite executives (CEO, CFO, COO, CDO/CIO) to address challenges and align with their strategic objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Tailored Solutions &amp;amp; Strategic Alignment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Celonis Context Model and AI capabilities to address critical business needs, delivering measurable impact and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align strategies with clients&#39; long-term business goals to maximize platform adoption and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Leadership &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a highly collaborative cohort of peers featuring a great team who can tackle challenges together, a strong performance culture, and continuous shared learning experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate cross-functional teams, including Value Engineers, Service Consultants, Marketing, BDRs, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with a senior Account Executive in a dedicated 1:1 mentorship model to accelerate your professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the strategic and operational business needs of your target accounts and effectively communicate how Celonis and its AI-powered Process Intelligence Platform, will meet those to create real opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for delivering revenue in your allocated account patch by creating new business opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key stakeholder personas, cultivate strategic relationships, and build an internal network of champions to drive customer success and account expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage cross Line-of-Business at C-level and below within your target organizations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become proficient in driving the sales process, following a structured, staged, programmatic flow through prospect, initial call, qualify, pitch to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Value Engineering or personally conduct comprehensive presentations and demonstrations tailored to specific use cases, including Celonis AI, Process Intelligence Graph and industry-specific solutions, showcasing the value of our platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forge strong partnerships, particularly with leading consulting firms, tech partners, and the Big4.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with your team, which includes business development representatives, value engineers, partner managers, and marketing specialists, to ensure seamless collaboration and success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on AI trends, process automation, and digital transformation to position Celonis as the intelligent backbone of enterprise operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Track Record in Client-Facing Roles: &lt;/strong&gt;You bring 2–3 years of professional experience from a top-tier management consultancy, corporate strategy/transformation function, or leading enterprise technology company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Academic Foundation: &lt;/strong&gt;You studied Business Economics, Engineering, Informatics, or a related discipline. A Master&#39;s degree is preferred, but exceptional graduates with solid foundational knowledge are encouraged to apply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Drive &amp;amp; Career Acceleration: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re ready to accelerate your career in sales. You have a genuine interest in applying your professional experience to a dynamic sales environment and are excited to build expertise in enterprise software solutions and client success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen &amp;amp; Process Intelligence Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;You have a sharp ability to quickly understand how companies operate, identify inefficiencies, and recognize where Process Intelligence and AI unlock real value and drive transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Forward Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re genuinely curious about AI and emerging technologies, driven to deepen your business acumen, and passionate about understanding business processes and KPIs—particularly in Finance, Supply Chain, or operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; You bring familiarity or hands-on experience in Manufacturing, Automotive, Consumer Goods, Retail, Financial Services, Telecommunications, or Utilities. This foundation helps you quickly grasp client contexts and add immediate value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;: You communicate complex, strategic ideas with clarity and confidence in both English and German.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Independent Thinker&lt;/strong&gt;: You bring a forward-thinking mindset with analytical capabilities. You think strategically, operate independently, and are comfortable owning challenges and driving solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/celonis/associate-account-executive-top-talent-sales-program-lunar-dach-munich-312838","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"Munich","created_at":1793472923},{"slug":"senior-specialist-market-planning-berlin-172114","company_name":"wolt","title":"Senior Specialist, Market Planning","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Wolt, keeping courier supply healthy across every city we operate in is core to a great experience for both customers and couriers. As we&#39;ve scaled to dozens of countries and hundreds of cities, planning &amp;amp; managing supply has grown from a market-by-market exercise into a global challenge: we need a system that plans well everywhere at once, from our largest metros to our smallest cities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s where this role comes in. As Senior Specialist, Global Market Planning, you&#39;ll help refine the models and tools at the heart of how we plan courier supply globally. You&#39;ll make sure the right supply levers are pulled in the right markets, and you&#39;ll help us learn which levers actually work. It&#39;s a role at the crossroads of data, tooling, and operations. It&#39;s for someone who is as comfortable designing a test or building a model as they are working out why a specific market is off plan and what to do about it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of the Global Market Planning team and will partner closely with local operations and courier marketing so that our planning always reflects the reality on the ground.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop the global planning model:&lt;/strong&gt; Help develop and refine our global supply planning model so it delivers robust coverage across both large and small cities, accounting for local context like holidays, special events, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allocate investments across markets:&lt;/strong&gt; Help optimize supply lever allocation, translating region and country budgets into the right mix of levers for each market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test and learn in markets: &lt;/strong&gt;Propose tests and actions within markets, in line with lever allocation, especially where we don&#39;t yet know the right answer or don&#39;t have enough data to rely on history. You&#39;ll work with local teams and analytics to shape the approach and turn what we learn into the next plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop tools that ensure the correct supply levers are being used effectively across markets to hit our targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep dive &amp;amp; solve:&lt;/strong&gt; Investigate problem areas, identify root causes, and turn your findings into corrective actions and better planning approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with regional supply leads, local operations teams, and central teams (finance, procurement, product, analytics) on plans, performance, and improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve how we work:&lt;/strong&gt; Test and prove new concepts in planning, acquisition, onboarding, and activation, and support the roll-out of global improvements across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in consulting, operations, analytics, or strategic business development in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and modelling skills, with a structured, pragmatic approach to solving complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and interpreting tests or causal analyses, and good judgment about what you can and can&#39;t conclude from them in a marketplace setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems view of supply: you consider trade-offs between levers and their knock-on effects on cost, courier experience, and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort making and defending recommendations with incomplete data, and adapting your thinking when the facts change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL, Looker, and Excel/Google Sheets modelling. Python, Cursor, and Claude Code are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An attitude for action and ownership beyond the obvious, always looking for opportunities to improve, with the determination to drive change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work across cross-functional teams and manage relationships with stakeholders, both local and global.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A true culture champion who leads by example with collaboration, teamwork, and data-driven decision making, and who brings humility and respect to every interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and oral communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Berlin or Helsinki, with the ability to work in a hybrid model from our Wolt office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What to expect from our hiring process:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent Acquisition screen — an introductory conversation with our recruiter to learn more about your background and answer any initial questions about the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hiring Manager interview — a deeper conversation with the team manager about your experience, the team, and what this role involves day to day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assignment — a practical task related to the role, giving you a chance to show how you approach real problems in this space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final interview — a conversation with a senior stakeholder to round out the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are excited about working in a high-growth environment, taking ownership and being part of an extremely ambitious team, then click below to apply and get the conversation going!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will be reviewing applications on an ongoing basis, so if this sounds like an opportunity you want to pursue, apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please submit your up-to-date resume in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/wolt/senior-specialist-market-planning-berlin-172114","tags":["Courier Operations"],"job_types":[],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1793472922},{"slug":"backend-engineer-golang-transfers-europe-berlin-429399","company_name":"sumup","title":"Backend Engineer (Golang) - Transfers Europe","description":"&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we empower small businesses with simple, affordable tools to start, run, and grow. Our &lt;strong&gt;Global Bank teams&lt;/strong&gt; build the financial services that help merchants manage their money and keep their businesses moving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For merchants, a transfer should feel simple. Behind that experience is a complex network of payment schemes, banks, providers, messages, certificates, reconciliations, and edge cases—all of which need to work together reliably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transfers Europe squad&lt;/strong&gt; is the integration layer connecting SumUp’s internal systems with the financial networks that move money across Europe and the UK. We build and run the backend services behind SEPA and UK transfer flows, helping move money accurately and reliably across external networks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineer,&lt;/strong&gt; you’ll take ownership of services that process real money. You’ll work on complex systems problems to ensure seamless integrations as we scale, while seeing a direct connection between your engineering decisions and merchant trust.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you enjoy understanding how systems behave under real-world conditions while improving them over time, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our tech stack &lt;/strong&gt;includes Golang, AWS, Kafka, PostgreSQL, Redis and Kubernetes, supported by a strong observability toolchain with Prometheus, Grafana, and Honeycomb. We also actively use AI‑assisted development tools such as Cursor, GitHub Copilot, and others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain &lt;strong&gt;production money movement backend services&lt;/strong&gt;, contributing to their delivery, observability, and ongoing maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver well‑defined tasks and &lt;strong&gt;features&lt;/strong&gt;, and contribute to larger projects within the team’s domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical &lt;strong&gt;design&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;implementation&lt;/strong&gt;, following established architectural patterns and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve service &lt;strong&gt;reliability&lt;/strong&gt; and quality by writing &lt;strong&gt;tests&lt;/strong&gt;, enhancing &lt;strong&gt;monitoring&lt;/strong&gt;, and following established delivery pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the operation of the systems you work on by participating in on‑call rotations, incident response, and learning from post‑incident reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply a backend and systems perspective during refinement, raising questions about risks, dependencies, and edge cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, QA, and other engineers to deliver end‑to‑end transfer and banking capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be great for this role if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience building backend services in a modern environment and supporting them in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in Golang and and comfortable learning and working with other languages as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working with cloud‑based systems, containerized workloads, and automated delivery pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise well-scoped pull requests, conduct thorough code reviews, and help maintain high standards of code quality and test coverage across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the fundamentals of system architecture, data modelling, and API design, and are eager to deepen this knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are curious about how your work fits into the broader system and product experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly and collaborate effectively with engineers, product managers, and other stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Any of the following would be considered a plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to banking, payments, or financial systems, especially in regulated environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting systems with production traffic, including participating in incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use of AI‑assisted tools to improve development speed, learning, or code quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🩺 Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, subsidised office lunches&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-gccz cui-body-m-0hb4 cui-body-regular-g1zg cui-body-normal-pxkh css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing a vast set of simple and affordable business tools to help them start, run, and grow their businesses. Today, over 4 million businesses in 36 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in our diverse team of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/1axu-TmW088?si=5NjHKNq5n-1GbXc2&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/XEH_nmJ9KZ4?si=pr6TdFl98FhpD5KG&quot;&gt;culture&lt;/a&gt; and driving our success. We foster an inclusivity and continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Explore career opportunities with us and join a team driven by collaboration, innovation, and a shared vision of creating a world where everyone can build a thriving business. Discover more about our vibrant and inclusive work culture and how we work on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;our careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/sumup/backend-engineer-golang-transfers-europe-berlin-429399","tags":["Backend"],"job_types":[],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1793472921},{"slug":"business-development-representative-german-speaking-all-genders-munich-177271","company_name":"Kertos","title":"Business Development Representative - German Speaking (all genders)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Compliance</strong> is what stands between a European company and its next enterprise deal. <strong>Kertos</strong> clears it. <strong>Information security, data protection, and AI management</strong> run in <strong>one system</strong> covering ISO 27001, GDPR, NIS2, the EU AI Act, and more, with <strong>certified experts on the project </strong>from start to finish.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>KAIA, our AI assistant</strong>, drafts the policies, checks the evidence, and monitors the controls, <strong>eliminating roughly 80% of manual work</strong>.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>400+ customers, including Personio, Enpal, Flink, and Blacklane</strong> use Kertos. Every audit with us has been successful. A powerhouse of 75+ people in Munich and Berlin and a €14M Series A behind us. <strong>We are hiring for what comes next! </strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Deine Mission bei Kertos</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du wirst ein wesentlicher Bestandteil unseres Growth Teams und bist Ambassador unserer Mission, Europas führende SaaS-Lösung für eine vollautomatische Compliance zu etablieren. Unterstützt von führenden VCs, haben wir letztes Jahr ein Wachstum von 4x erzielt und sind nun auf dem Weg die führende Compliance Plattform in Europa zu werden - und dafür brauchen wir dich! Du sorgst für eine volle Pipeline, qualifizierst und begeisterst Leads im Erstkontakt von unserer Lösung und treibst so gemeinsam mit dem Team unser Umsatzwachstum voran.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ownership vom ersten Tag an: </strong>Du generierst Opportunities über Messages, Calls oder andere kreative Kampagnen und bringst sie durch geschicktes Prospecting in unsere Pipeline</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Strategische Lead-Generierung: </strong>Du nutzt moderne Tools wie Cognism, Amplemarket, Clay und HubSpot, um zielgerichtet und effizient neue B2B-Kunden zu identifizieren und für uns zu begeistern</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Pitching auf C-Level: </strong>Du sprichst mit Entscheider*innen aus Startups, Scale-ups und Mittelstandsunternehmen und überzeugst sie von unserem Produkt</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Data-Driven Selling:</strong> Du analysierst Metriken, optimierst deine Outreach-Strategie und lernst, datenbasiert bessere Ergebnisse zu erzielen</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Enge Zusammenarbeit mit Sales &amp; Marketing:</strong> Du arbeitest eng mit unseren Account Executives und dem Growth-Team zusammen, um eine nahtlose Customer Journey zu schaffen</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Deine Skills, Motivation und Mentalität, die dich erfolgreich machen</strong></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du hast idealerweise bereits erste Sales / Business Development Erfahrung im B2B SaaS gesammelt, z. B. als SDR, BDR oder in einer ähnlichen Position</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du musst (noch) keine Closing-Erfahrung haben – aber gerne die Motivation, dich in Richtung Account Executive weiterzuentwickeln</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Dank deiner starken zwischenmenschlichen und Kommunikationsfähigkeiten fällt es dir leicht, Beziehungen aufzubauen</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Dein Denken ist unternehmerisch geprägt – kreativ und stets auf der Suche nach neuen Business Opportunities</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du hast ein High-Performance-Mindset und bist gerne Teil eines ambitionierten Teams, das sich ständig pusht, Best Practices teilt und sich gegenseitig zum Erfolg treibt</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fließende Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Warum Kertos</strong></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Dein Erfolg ist unser Erfolg</strong>: Du partizipierst am Unternehmenserfolg durch unseren Virtual Share Incentive Plan (VSIP)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Cutting Edge AI Technologie</strong>: Führende VCs haben in unsere Vision und nachhaltiges Wachstum investiert, damit wir nachhaltig verändern, wie Compliance-Maßnahmen gehandhabt werden</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Großer Impact</strong>: Bei uns bekommst du Verantwortung ab Tag 1, arbeitest selbstständig an Themen und bringst so Kertos richtig voran</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Starkes Onboarding</strong>: Keine Ahnung von Compliance? Kein Problem, wir schlauen dich auf und stellen dir einen Onboarding-Buddy an die Seite</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Regelmäßiges Feedback</strong>: Wir leben eine offene Feedbackkultur und unterstützen dich bei deinem Wachstum mit regelmäßigen 1-1s, 360 Grad Feedback, Schulungen und einem Top Netzwerk von Expert*innen</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Mental Health</strong>: In Zusammenarbeit mit nilo legen wir Wert auf dein Wohlbefinden und bieten allen Mitarbeitenden individuelle Unterstützung für ihre mentale Gesundheit</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Keep growing</strong>: Um deine berufliche und persönliche Weiterentwicklung zu unterstützen, stellen wir dir ein jährliches Budget von 1.500€ zur Verfügung</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Volle Flexibilität</strong>: Ob im Münchner Hauptquartier oder aus dem Homeoffice (2-3 Mal pro Woche) – wir sind flexibel und du happy</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Für Sportsfreund*innen</strong>: Wir bezuschussen deine Wellpass-Mitgliedschaft für den sportlichen Ausgleich zum Arbeitsalltag</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Fahrrad Leasing</strong>: Neues Fahrrad gefällig? Easy, nutze unser unsere Partnerschaft mit JobRad und lease dir ein Fahrrad</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Gemeinsam stark</strong>: Wir arbeiten über unsere Standorte hinweg eng zusammen, unterstützen uns gegenseitig und schaffen durch echtes Miteinander eine starke, einzigartige Kultur, die uns erfolgreich macht.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Regelmäßige Team-Events</strong>: Ob Brunch, Lunch oder After Work,wir nehmen uns regelmäßig Zeit, auch jenseits des Arbeitsalltags gemeinsam Zeit zu verbringen und Spaß zu haben.Dazu kommen legendäre Sommer- und Winterpartys sowie jährliche Offsites</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Klingt, als suchen wir nach dir?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du willst Teil unserer Wachstumsstory sein und mit uns den Weg ebnen, Europas Compliance-Leader zu werden? Dann melde dich bei uns. Wir freuen uns auf deine Bewerbung! Falls du vorher noch Fragen hast, melde dich jederzeit bei Julia, unsere Talent Acquisition Partner.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/kertos/business-development-representative-german-speaking-all-genders-munich-177271","tags":["Growth"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Munich","created_at":1793472015},{"slug":"founding-product-manager-german-speaking-munich-285512","company_name":"Bowatt","title":"Founding Product Manager (German-speaking)","description":"<h2>About BoWatt</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">BoWatt is building agentic requirements and systems engineering software for manufacturing.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We believe AI will reach PhD-level engineering capability within the next 10 years. This will unlock massive value across complex manufacturing industries. Cars. Planes. Rockets. Factories. Chips. Medical devices. All will be engineered with agents.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We bootstrapped BoWatt to €500k+ ARR before raising our first round. BoWatt is backed by tier-1 investors, including Atlantic Foodlabs, Buildery (CDTM affiliates), and Prequel Ventures, along with angels from Cohere and Luminovo.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll join a small team of startup builders focused on speed, ownership, and execution. Over half the team are former founders, with backgrounds across DeepTech AI, gaming, and other startups. We’ve studied and worked at institutions and companies including Stanford, TUM, Google, EA, and YC-backed AI startups.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>The role</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">As our Founding Product Manager, you will help determine what BoWatt builds, why we build it, and whether it creates meaningful value for customers.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will work closely across our commercial, customer success and engineering teams, as well as with our customers. You will develop a deep understanding of complex engineering workflows, turn customer problems into clear product opportunities, and drive initiatives from discovery through launch and iteration.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a hands-on product role. You will spend time with customers, work through technical and operational detail, write requirements, make trade-offs, test solutions, and help the team ship quickly.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead product discovery - translate complex workflows and customer needs into clear product requirements and success criteria</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop a deep understanding of how manufacturing and systems-engineering teams work</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify and define the highest-value customer problems for BoWatt to solve</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help own and prioritise the product roadmap</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Balance strategic opportunities, recurring customer needs, commercial importance, and engineering effort</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive product initiatives from initial discovery through scoping, development, launch, and iteration</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Give engineers the context and clarity needed to make strong implementation decisions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prototype and test potential solutions with customers before and during development</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with Customer Success to turn individual customer feedback into scalable product improvements</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use qualitative feedback and product data to understand adoption and evaluate whether features are working</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Triage product issues and bugs, make clear prioritisation decisions, and coordinate with Engineering</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Improve BoWatt’s processes for discovery, prioritisation, product delivery, launches, and feedback</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop deep expertise in BoWatt’s product, customers, and target industries</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">During your first six months, you will work closely with our engineering team to build the domain and product knowledge required to take ownership of increasingly important product areas.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>You</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are deeply curious about customers and want to understand how their work actually happens</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You enjoy turning complex, ambiguous problems into clear product decisions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You combine strategic thinking with hands-on execution</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You can distinguish between an individual customer request and a scalable product opportunity</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You make thoughtful trade-offs and are comfortable deciding with incomplete information</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You write clearly, communicate confidently, and know how to get to the point</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are comfortable working closely with software engineers and discussing technical constraints</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You move quickly without losing sight of product quality or customer outcomes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You take ownership of results rather than simply managing tickets and meetings</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You want to build a product function rather than inherit an established playbook</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are ambitious, resourceful, and excited to become an expert in a complex industry</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Requirements</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">At least two years of experience in Product Management, Product Ownership, Product Operations, or a comparable product-building role</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience shipping B2B software in close collaboration with engineers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience conducting product discovery and translating customer problems into clear requirements</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong prioritisation, project management, and stakeholder-management skills</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to understand technical products and communicate with engineers, technical users, and business stakeholders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent German required; English is our internal working language</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Four days per week in our Munich office at Balanstraße</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with enterprise software, AI products, manufacturing, engineering, systems engineering, or early-stage startups is a bonus</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive salary based on experience</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Participation in BoWatt’s Founders Pool: 5–10% virtual equity package</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Significant ownership over an important part of BoWatt’s product</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The opportunity to help build BoWatt’s product function and ways of working</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">25 vacation days per year, plus public holidays</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Company retreats</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">WellPass membership</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>The Founders Pool</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">BoWatt’s Founders Pool is a dedicated virtual-equity pool for a small group of early team members who take responsibility for building and leading a major part of the company.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">We created it because we want the people building BoWatt alongside us to participate meaningfully in the value they help create. These are not narrow execution roles with finished playbooks. You will own your vertical with co-founder-like autonomy and accountability: setting the standard, making difficult trade-offs, and being responsible for the results.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">As our Founding Product Manager, you will participate in the Founders Pool (5-10%) and take meaningful ownership of how BoWatt’s product develops. The precise allocation, vesting structure, and plan terms will be discussed transparently during the interview process.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Interview process</h2><ol style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">20-minute screening call </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">90-minute live product case (CEO and team member) </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">60-minute culture interview (CEO)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Reference checks &amp; Offer</p></li></ol><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We aim to complete the entire interview process within 14 days.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/bowatt/founding-product-manager-german-speaking-munich-285512","tags":["Product Success"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Munich","created_at":1793472014},{"slug":"senior-manager-business-development-all-genders-berlin-387973","company_name":"Sunday Natural","title":"(Senior) Manager Business Development (all genders)","description":"<h2><strong>Your role</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">As the market leader for health supplements in Germany, we have ambitious plans to expand our reach and bring high-quality products to more customers internationally. Backed by our founder and our leading strategic private equity partner CVC, we are positioned for rapid growth. We are looking for a <strong>Berlin-based</strong> <strong>(Senior) Manager Business Development (all genders)</strong> to drive our most critical strategic initiatives with us. Working closely with the Lead Business Development and the CFO, you will play a central role in shaping and executing our company-wide growth strategy hands-on. If you excel at turning complex challenges into clear operational plans, thrive in a fast-paced environment, and enjoy leading cross-functional projects, this role offers an exceptional opportunity to make a lasting impact.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><strong>Lead Strategic Projects (70%)</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lead high-impact strategic projects</strong> across the business (incl. internationalization, marketing, operations, finance) to deliver our long-term strategy with your hands-on operational execution power<em> - leave your mark.</em></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Proactively identify strategic opportunities</strong> to grow the business, scope the project and execute your plan <em>- own the outcome.</em></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Mobilize teams across the organization</strong> to deliver your project objectives <em>- connect the dots.</em></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Drive Business Development Operations (30%)</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lead operational activities to realize our long-term strategy </strong>(e.g. steering our quarterly OKR process)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Prepare board (incl. private equity), senior management and company-wide updates</strong> on business performance and strategic priorities for our town halls and trainings</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Support the yearly target setting </strong>and the financial performance tracking, in close collaboration with the CFO</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Your profile</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">About 2 years of professional experience in top-tier management consulting (ideally MBB) or another analytical, fast-paced environment</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Master’s degree in Business, Economics, Management, or a related field</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A highly motivated and collaborative mindset, with the ability to take ownership and move ideas forward</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven track record of bringing structure to complex and ambiguous topics and independently drive strategic initiatives from analysis to execution</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong interest in the health, wellness, and nutrition space; previous experience in DTC, consumer goods, or e-commerce is a plus</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent written and verbal communication skills in German and English, with the ability to communicate effectively across teams and seniority levels</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to work from our Berlin office four days per week, with one day of home office</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What we offer</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An appealing discount on all of our products – from essential oils to vitamins &amp; nutrients</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We offer 28 days of paid time off per year plus up to 5 days off between Christmas and New Year</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The Urban Sports Club membership and either Swapfiets bike rental or a subsidy for the Deutschlandticket</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We believe great things happen when we meet in person, which is why we embrace a hybrid model with one home office day per week – up to two depending on the area you are working in – and up to two weeks per year working from abroad</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Receive various discounts of up to more than 50 percent on attractive brands such as Flaconi, Bosch, Apple or Expedia</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will be given real ownership and plenty of room for new initiatives, as well as the opportunity to contribute your expertise and implement your great ideas</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We like to celebrate each other! Regular tea &amp; office parties, Christmas and summer feasts and various influencer events such as Women's Day</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are looking forward to your application!</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Sunday Natural </strong>emerged from a long-standing passion and research in the fields of health, healing, and personal growth. The lack of natural, high-quality products on the market was the original motivation for founding Sunday Natural in 2013. We aim to produce the products we ourselves would love to buy – as natural as possible, absolutely pure, free from any additives, and of the highest quality. In a strategic partnership with CVC, Sunday Natural is now one of Germany's most renowned quality manufacturers, with its own research and development department in Berlin. For the continuous improvement of our products, we collaborate with selected research institutes, scientists, therapists, farmers, and professional associations. <br /><br />Our diverse team in Berlin consists of over 400 employees from more than 45 nationalities and continues to grow – but at a sustainable pace. Our goal is to foster a collaborative, supportive, and inclusive work environment with a diverse group of motivated, talented, and visionary team members.<br /><br /><em>We highly value equality of opportunity and inclusivity, and we would like to particularly encourage women and candidates from under-represented backgrounds to apply, even if you don’t match with 100% of the requirements.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.sunday.de/impressum/">Legal Notice</a></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/sunday-natural/senior-manager-business-development-all-genders-berlin-387973","tags":["Business Development"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1793472013},{"slug":"google-ads-manager-ai-first-performance-marketing-remote-59473","company_name":"Evolve Digital GmbH","title":"Google Ads Manager – AI-First Performance Marketing (m/w/d) · Remote","description":"<figure><img style="width:920px" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/yde53saa19/05-07_-_Company_-_Evolve_GmbH-9496.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Google Ads verändert sich durch AI schneller als je zuvor. Wir suchen deshalb keinen klassischen Ads Manager, sondern jemanden, der Lust hat, Performance Marketing neu zu denken und die Zukunft des Kanals mitzugestalten.</span></strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Bei EVOLVE Digital arbeiten wir AI-first, datengetrieben und mit klarem Fokus auf messbare Ergebnisse. Gemeinsam mit einem Team aus über 25 E-Commerce-Spezialisten betreust du Wachstumskunden – 100 % remote, mit viel Eigenverantwortung und ohne Mikromanagement. Wir wachsen weiter und suchen einen Senio