e="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design and implement efficient claims processes and procedures, and make sure they are adopted and hold up as the team grows.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and manage the KPIs and metrics we use to handle claims and run the organisation as efficiently as possible.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Analyse operational data to understand problems, surface insights, and turn them into practical solutions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Take ownership of small projects and support complex cross-functional initiatives, from scoping through to delivery.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with teams across the company to make operational changes land quickly.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">We love working together in the office, so this is a full-time, office-based role in our London office. We’re a high-intensity team and often put in significant time and effort, because we believe great outcomes come from doing the work well.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Qualifications</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">2+ years of experience in consulting, data or analytics, or operations at a startup, tech firm or consultancy</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrated experience working with data to provide insights, understand problems and deliver effective solutions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrated experience implementing solutions and running small projects or changes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong written and spoken communication, with a proven ability to work cross-functionally</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A generalist mindset: comfortable picking up whatever problem matters most and moving quickly</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Insurance or claims experience is a plus, but not required</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Our Values</strong></p><ul style