utomations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Take what you learn from Partners back to the Product team, so every onboarding is faster than the last.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">We love working together in the office, so this is a full-time, office-based role in our London office. We're a high-intensity team and often put in significant time and effort, because we believe great outcomes come from doing the work well.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Qualifications</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">5+ years in operations, implementation or consulting at a high-growth startup, tech firm or consultancy</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrated experience working directly with external Partners or clients, in a role where you owned the relationship</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A track record of implementing systems and processes across multiple regions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience leading system integrations or technology rollouts for external clients</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to lead without authority, coordinating peers across Sales, Claims, Product and Account Management to get things done</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Expertise turning chaos into process, and ensuring those processes survive as the team grows</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong written and spoken communication with Partners and with internal teams</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Insurance or claims experience is a plus, but not required</p></li></ul><h2>Our Values</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Move Fast – Act decisively, iterate quickly, optimise for momentum.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Always Overdeliver – We exceed expectations in everything we do.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Think Customer-First, Always – The customer experience drives every decision.</p></li><li><p style="min-height: