&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/elastic/senior-information-security-infrastructure-engineer-security-architecture-infosec-466908","tags":["InfoSec"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1793516115},{"slug":"social-media-manager-remote-united-kingdom-122909","company_name":"Reedsy","title":"Social Media Manager - Remote","description":"<h2><strong>About Reedsy</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re here to give authors the tools and resources they need to create beautiful books. Our marketplace gathers the industry's best publishing professionals — the likes of Neil Gaiman's editor, Nora Roberts' book marketer, and GRRM’s cover designer.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’ve grown to a community of 5,000,000 authors and transformed the way people write and publish their books. Want to hop on board and help us get to our next destination? Cool, keep reading!</p><h2><strong>Job Description</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re looking for a social media expert to turn our ideas, expertise, products, and community into sharp, useful content that writers actually want to engage with. That means finding the right balance between education, inspiration, and entertainment. You will:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own and grow Reedsy’s presence across our key social channels.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turn Reedsy’s expertise, products, and community into clear, engaging content for writers and publishing professionals.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop recurring formats, campaigns, and creative concepts that feel recognizably Reedsy, working alongside our writers and design team to further define and evolve the brand.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design a creator and influencer program to bring Reedsy to new audiences</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Track performance, identify what resonates, and use those insights to continuously refine our content and social strategy.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Both a very analytical and highly creative individual, able to use performance data to inform great content.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven experience growing a brand to a large audience, ideally in a fast-growing startup environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A track record of social campaigns that created measurable impact — and examples to prove it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent editorial instincts and a strong command of written English.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A deep understanding of what makes social content useful, engaging, and shareable.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to explain complex ideas simply without dumbing them down.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A genuine interest in writing, publishing, books, or the creator economy.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Bonus Points</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience creating short-form video content.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with the publishing industry or the challenges independent authors face.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent in multiple languages.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A good dose of ambition, a willingness to learn, and a great sense of humor.</p></l