<p><span data-contrast="auto">As a Security Operations Engineer, you will help protect DiliTrust's SaaS platform, cloud infrastructure, networks and production environments. You will join the Infrastructure &amp; Security team, a 12-person team spread across France, Canada and Spain, and work in an international context (Europe, North America and EMA). The infrastructure you will secure is managed in an automated way and counts more than 350 assets hosted across our cloud providers.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">You will contribute to the continuous improvement of our security posture through monitoring, incident response, vulnerability management, hardening and automation, and you will work closely with infrastructure, DevOps, development and product teams so that security is embedded into our architectures, operations and delivery processes.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
