</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">In this role, your main responsibilities will include:</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Security monitoring &amp; incident response</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">· Monitor the security of networks, cloud infrastructure, systems, applications and endpoints.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">· Administer, configure and continuously improve our security tools, including CNAPP, SIEM, EDR, bastion, ZTNA, PKI, antivirus and WAF solutions.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">· Continuously evolve our detection mechanisms and threat-detection scenarios.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">· Investigate security alerts and incidents, support incident handling, and contribute to root-cause analysis, remediation and post-incident reviews.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Hardening, vulnerabilities &amp; secure architecture</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">· Implement hardening measures and support vulnerability identification, prioritization, remediation and follow-up through action plans.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">· Validate the security aspects of IT architectures and application projects.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">· Actively participate in security audits and penetration tests: scoping, support during the exercise, remediation of findings and follow-up.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">· Test products and run technical validations on prototype environments before they reach production.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Automation &amp; Infrastructure as Code</span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">· Automate deployments and security / infrastructure operations using Infrastructure as Code, configuration management and scripting.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">· Create and maintain security procedures, incident-response playbooks, operational documentation and technical standards.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
