<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">· Good knowledge of PKI and certificate management: CA hierarchies, certificate lifecycle (issuance, renewal, revocation, automation), TLS / mTLS, key and secret management.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">· Administration of security tools: CNAPP, SIEM, EDR, bastion, ZTNA and PKI, including interpreting security events and alerts.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720}">&nbsp;</span></p>
