="min-height:1.5em"><u>HR Operations</u></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate preboarding and onboarding activities, including background checks, system entry, equipment, relocation coordination, and orientation.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with hiring managers and cross-functional teams to ensure new employees have a smooth, engaging start.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support new-hire check-ins and identify opportunities to improve the onboarding experience.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support employee lifecycle processes, including new hires, employment changes, internal transfers, and departures.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Assist with HR reporting, audits, and other operational projects as needed.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate with external payroll providers, benefits partners, and local HR or employment advisors as needed.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support compliance with applicable Swiss employment requirements and internal policies in partnership with the Fractional HR leader and relevant local experts.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><u>Collaboration &amp; Continuous Improvement</u></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with the Fractional HR leader to prioritize recruiting and people initiatives aligned with business objectives.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build trusted relationships with employees, hiring managers, and cross-functional partners.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Handle confidential employee and candidate information with discretion and sound judgment