uted employees preferred</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Required Tech Stack Experience</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with Jira or Jira Service Management</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable managing identity in Okta, Entra, or similar</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience using Jamf, Iru, or Intune</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Expert in Google Workspace, Slack, and Zoom</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2>What Sets You Apart?</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You've supported a hybrid or distributed workforce and are comfortable switching between in-person and remote troubleshooting</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You've contributed to onboarding/offboarding or endpoint management processes that improved speed or consistency</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You're proactive about documenting fixes and updating knowledge base content for the next person</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Relevant certifications such as CompTIA A+, ITIL Foundation, or similar</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in high-growth SaaS or cybersecurity companies</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"> </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Perks of Horizon3</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Inclusive Team: We value diversity and promote an inclusive culture where everyone can thrive.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Growth Opportunities: Be part of a dynamic and growing team with numerous career development opportunities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Innovative Culture: Work in a collaborative environment that encourages creativity and out-of-the-box thinking.</p></li