&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/swissitsecuritygroup/iam-software-engineer-waardenburg-gelderland-188228","tags":["Software Development"],"job_types":[],"location":"Waardenburg, Gelderland","created_at":1793343318},{"slug":"commercial-account-executive-uk-amsterdam-188057","company_name":"Horizon3Ai","title":"Commercial Account Executive, UK","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Get to Know Us</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Horizon3.ai is a fast-growing, remote cybersecurity company dedicated to the mission of enabling organisations to proactively find and fix and verify exploitable attack vectors before criminals exploit them. Our flagship product,  the NodeZeroTM platform, delivers production-safe autonomous pentests and other key assessment operations that scale across the largest internal, external, cloud, and hybrid cloud environments. NodeZero has been adopted by organisations of all sizes, from small educational institutions to government agencies and Global 100 enterprises. It is used by ITOps/SecOps teams, consulting pentesters, and MSSPs and MSPs.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are a fusion of former U.S. Special Operations cyber operators, startup engineers, and formerly frustrated cybersecurity practitioners. We're committed to helping solve our common security problems: ineffective security tools, false positives resulting in alert fatigue, blind spots, "checkbox” security culture, cybersecurity skills shortage, and the long lead time and expense of hiring outside consultants. Collectively, we are a team of learn it alls, committed to a culture of respect, collaboration, ownership, and results.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Role Description</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help shape the next stage of Horizon3.ai’s UK growth. Based in the Netherlands with regular UK travel, you’ll bring autonomous pentesting to new customers and help them reduce real-world security risk. If you thrive on opening doors, building partnerships and turning opportunities into wins, this is a chance to make a visible impact as we expand our UK Commercial team.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We currently require our Amsterdam team to come to the office 2 - 3 days per week. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3>What You’ll Do</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Grow Horizon3.ai’s UK Commercial business by winning new customers, developing productive channel partnerships and helping organisations realise value from our cybersecurity solutions.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Win new accounts and expand our customer base by introducing disruptive cybersecurity software solutions to the UK market.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and convert a qualified pipeline, owning the sales cycle from qualification and proof of value through negotiation and close, with the goal of exceeding quota consistently quarter over quarter.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turn channel partnerships into revenue by proactively engaging regional resellers and developing joint opportunities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrate Horizon3.ai solutions in virtual and in-person meetings, connecting technical capabilities to customer needs and business outcomes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive the post-proof of value ROI process, helping customers understand business value while building relationships that support satisfaction and retention.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain accurate customer records, pipeline data and forecasts in Salesforce so opportunities, risks and next steps are clearly understood.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work independently to progress opportunities while collaborating with distributed sales, support and customer success teams to deliver a coordinated customer experience.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3>What You’ll Bring</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">At least 5 years of successful cybersecurity sales experience, with a track record of driving growth, introducing disruptive software solutions and consistently exceeding quarterly quotas.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Previous experience selling technical solutions into the UK market.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience establishing and monetising channel partnerships; existing relationships with key regional resellers are essential.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proficiency across the full sales process, including qualification, proof of value, forecasting, negotiation, deal closure and post-proof of value ROI management.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to present and demonstrate cybersecurity solutions effectively, both virtually and in person.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong CRM discipline and experience maintaining accurate pipeline records and forecasts in Salesforce (SFDC).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with Challenger Question-Based Selling-type methodologies and sales tools such as <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://outreach.io/">Outreach</a>, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, ZoomInfo and Slack.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to work independently and collaborate effectively with distributed teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluency in English; additional language skills are welcomed.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3><strong>Travel Required</strong></h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are a hybrid company, and this job will require you to spend 3 days based at our Amsterdam city centre sales hub. The role may require up to 40% of travel within the assigned territory to be successful. Job-related travel expenses are reviewed and must be approved by your manager.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Perks of </strong><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Horizon3.ai"><strong>Horizon3.ai</strong></a></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Inclusive Team: We value diversity and promote an inclusive culture where everyone can thrive.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Growth Opportunities: Be part of a dynamic and growing team with numerous career development opportunities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Innovative Culture: Work in a collaborative environment that encourages creativity and out-of-the-box thinking.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Remote Work: We are a 100% remote company. Enjoy the flexibility to work in the way that supports you and brings out your best.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive Compensation: We offer competitive salary, equity and benefits. Our benefits include health, vision &amp; dental insurance for you and your family, a flexible vacation policy, and generous parental leave.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You Belong Here</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Horizon3.ai">Horizon3.ai</a> is not just an equal opportunity employer - we are a community that values diversity, equity, and inclusion as fundamental principles of our culture and success. We are dedicated to fostering a workplace where everyone feels welcome and respected, regardless of race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, disability, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, marital status, hair length or any other legally protected status by law.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our commitment to diversity and inclusion means we strive to attract, develop, and retain a 